      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306466975113216
    m_Localized: UTILITIES
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306466975113217
    m_Localized: When active you resurrect immediately after death.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306466979307520
    m_Localized: SINGLE USE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306466983501824
    m_Localized: Resurrection Wings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306466983501825
    m_Localized: 'Activate during your run by double tapping the screen, or pause the game and select the Res-Wings utility. Lasts 30 seconds after activation. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306466987696128
    m_Localized: 'Activate during your run by holding the center button for 1 second, or pause the game and select the Res-Wings utility. Lasts 30 seconds after activation. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306466987696129
    m_Localized: 'Activate during your run by pressing the north (Y/△) gamepad button, or pause the game and select the Res-Wings utility. Lasts 30 seconds after activation. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306466991890432
    m_Localized: 'Activate during your run by pressing the [R] key, or pause the game and select the Res-Wings utility. Lasts 30 seconds after activation. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306466996084736
    m_Localized: Okay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306466996084737
    m_Localized: OK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306467000279040
    m_Localized: Resurrection wings that are active permanently.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306467004473344
    m_Localized: Perma-Wings
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306467004473345
    m_Localized: Pause the game and select the Perma-wings utility at the beginning of the game to activate. You will auto-resurrect as soon as you die.
    m_Metadata:
