    m_Localized: Run Again
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468015300608
    m_Localized: Upgrades
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468019494912
    m_Localized: Your Best Score!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468019494913
    m_Localized: Simply mystifying!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468023689216
    m_Localized: An ancient dance of hokey pokey.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468027883520
    m_Localized: You fell to your death.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468027883521
    m_Localized: Aaaaaaaah!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468032077824
    m_Localized: You fell to your death.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468036272128
    m_Localized: But I'm scared of heights!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468036272129
    m_Localized: End of the road...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468040466432
    m_Localized: Mind the gap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468044660736
    m_Localized: Missed it by *that* much.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468044660737
    m_Localized: Not again!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468048855040
    m_Localized: I'm reporting this safety violation!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468053049344
    m_Localized: I knew I should have learned how to fly!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468053049345
    m_Localized: Adios!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468057243648
    m_Localized: Good thing I wore my helmet!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468061437952
    m_Localized: You made a tasty snack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468061437953
    m_Localized: Feeding time!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468065632256
    m_Localized: Swimming with the fishes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468065632257
    m_Localized: Snakes!? I hate snakes!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468069826560
    m_Localized: Bubble, bubble, bubble...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468074020864
    m_Localized: Where did you go?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468074020865
    m_Localized: Who let Barney out of his cage?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468078215168
    m_Localized: So close.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468082409472
    m_Localized: Is someone watching me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468082409473
    m_Localized: Man down!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468086603776
    m_Localized: Tree Hugger!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468090798080
    m_Localized: Trees hurt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468090798081
    m_Localized: Are we bugging you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468094992384
    m_Localized: Ants. Why did it have to be ants?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468099186688
    m_Localized: I always make a good impression.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468099186689
    m_Localized: I'll just leave that here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468103380992
    m_Localized: Who left this tree here?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468107575296
    m_Localized: I left my mark on the world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468107575297
    m_Localized: At least my hat is safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468111769600
    m_Localized: I need a time out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468111769601
    m_Localized: Two lovebirds...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468115963904
    m_Localized: Mind if I hang out?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468120158208
    m_Localized: I didn't see that there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468120158209
    m_Localized: It hurts the tree more than me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468124352512
    m_Localized: Not my hat!!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468128546816
    m_Localized: I'm not the same without my hat!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468132741120
    m_Localized: Harder than it looks...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468132741121
    m_Localized: Good thing I have a hard head!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468136935424
    m_Localized: My helmet didn't even help...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468141129728
    m_Localized: Hard to run without a head.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468141129729
    m_Localized: Don't forget to duck!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468145324032
    m_Localized: Knocked your socks off!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468149518336
    m_Localized: Looks like I'm stuck here a while.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468149518337
    m_Localized: Don't look at my hairy legs!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468153712640
    m_Localized: Should have worn my nice socks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468157906944
    m_Localized: Time to go back to Limbo 101.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468157906945
    m_Localized: Watch your step...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468162101248
    m_Localized: Temple slippery when wet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468166295552
    m_Localized: Mmmm, crispy explorer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468166295553
    m_Localized: Smells like toast.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468170489856
    m_Localized: Having a bad hair day?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468174684160
    m_Localized: I just had that dry cleaned!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468174684161
    m_Localized: 'Warning: Armor Not Fireproof.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468178878464
    m_Localized: You made a tasty snack.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468178878465
    m_Localized: I eat explorers like you for breakfast.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468183072768
    m_Localized: Nom nom... leathery!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468187267072
    m_Localized: Tackled just before the endzone!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468187267073
    m_Localized: This one has a shell!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468191461376
    m_Localized: Tackled!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468195655680
    m_Localized: All tangled up...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468195655681
    m_Localized: Caught you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468199849984
    m_Localized: Untied laces cause accidents.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468199849985
    m_Localized: I've gotta bad feeling about this...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468204044288
    m_Localized: If only I had my lighter...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468208238592
    m_Localized: This is not how I imagined my retirement.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468208238593
    m_Localized: Wonder where these skulls came from?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468212432896
    m_Localized: That's just unsanitary!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468216627200
    m_Localized: That looks like Uncle Hernan!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468220821504
