  - m_Id: 306468560560128
    m_Localized: SCORE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468560560129
    m_Localized: COINS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468564754432
    m_Localized: Adds extra coins to your inventory. Spend at the UPGRADES screen.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468568948736
    m_Localized: RESURRECTION WINGS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468573143040
    m_Localized: Activate anytime during your run to provide 30 seconds of protection against death. You'll revive automatically if you die while wearing these wings. See OPTIONS → "Controls Help" to learn how to activate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468573143041
    m_Localized: PERMA-WINGS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468577337344
    m_Localized: Don these special wings to instantly revive after the first death during your run. Activate from the pause menu during the first 100 meters of your run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468581531648
    m_Localized: HEAD START
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468581531649
    m_Localized: Invincibly proceed 1000 meters at the start of your run. Activate from the pause menu during the first 100 meters of your run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468585725952
    m_Localized: MEGA START
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468585725953
    m_Localized: Invincibly proceed 2500 meters at the start of your run. Activate from the pause menu during the first 100 meters of your run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468589920256
    m_Localized: REVIVE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468594114560
    m_Localized: Adds 1 revive to your inventory. Revives can be stockpiled then spent in succession for one super-long leaderboard attack!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468594114561
    m_Localized: QUICK FILL
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468598308864
    m_Localized: Semi-permanantly reduces your Revive refill time by the amount shown under the reward. Collect these to more quickly refill up to 3 revives, enabling more frequent long-plays. Quickfill rewards expire once every 4 weeks.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306468602503168
    m_Localized: Reward Info
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
