  - m_Id: 166668477815316483
    m_Localized: "You have currently given your consent to Imangi's disclosure of the advertising ID of your device to advertising network companies for marketing purposes in the game.\n\nAre you sure you want to withdraw consent?\n\n(Tapping YES will close the game; launch again for changes to take effect)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 166668477819510784
    m_Localized: IMPROVE AD EXPERIENCE?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 166668477819510785
    m_Localized: "Temple Run is supported by ads. To make these as relevant to you as possible, we would like to collect and share data with our ad partners. Please note that choosing No Thanks will not remove ads - instead, you may see ads that may be unrelated to your interests and therefore may not appeal to you. You can update your choice in Settings at any time.\n\n(Tapping YES will close the game; launch again for changes to take effect)"
    m_Metadata:
